  "plain": "A photo frame from the Apollo 11 Moon landing in 1969 is said to show a trio of lights, the same pattern seen in pictures from the later Apollo 17 mission. The researcher Maaneli Derakhshani points it out to Michels without naming a source: \"you see a trio of lights like that not just in Apollo 17, you also see it in Apollo 11.\" If true, the repeated pattern would suggest something real was near the astronauts on more than one mission."
